        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Landry's, Inc.\n- Products: Vic & Anthony's Steakhouse, Golden Nugget Las Vegas, California Club\n- Places: Downtown Houston, Las Vegas, Atlantic City, Nevada, Fremont Street Experience\n- People: Wynn\n\nFacts:\n- Vic & Anthony's Steakhouse is an American steakhouse restaurant chain with locations in Downtown Houston and inside Golden Nugget casinos in Las Vegas and Atlantic City.\n- Golden Nugget Las Vegas is a luxury hotel and casino in Las Vegas, Nevada, on the Fremont Street Experience.\n- Landry's, Inc. owns and operates the Golden Nugget Las Vegas property.\n- The California Club was combined into the Golden Nugget shortly after Wynn purchased it.",
